  "hints": [
    "At any index, the best non-empty subarray ending right here either continues the previous streak (cur + x) or starts fresh at x.",
    "Maintain current = max(x, current + x) and best = max(best, current), seeded at nums[0].",
    "Pseudocode:\n  if not nums: return 0\n  cur = best = nums[0]\n  for x in nums[1:]:\n      cur = max(x, cur + x)\n      best = max(best, cur)\n  return best"
